      "name": "Joseph Antel",
      "time": "2026-10-15T19:20:19.553145",
      "type": "transcript"
    },
    {
      "content": "Okay, no problem. Let's, let, let us handle everything now before I start asking with the about the inventory, I would like to know cause we talked to a lot of people everyday. And most of them would mention one or two concerns either they're worried the movers won't show up on time or they're going to damage the items. What about you, what either of this a concern to you?",
