    },
    {
      "contact_id": "agxzfnViZXItdm9pY2VyFAsSB0NvbnRhY3QYgICe8tyMqQgM",
      "content": "I mean, I wouldn't take a concern but it would be obviously problematic if either happens.",
      "name": "Joseph Antel",
      "time": "2026-10-15T19:20:47.753145",
      "type": "transcript"
    },
    {
      "content": "You definitely since you've had your experience with us before, let me just like, share again the on time guarantee and then our no worries, damage coverage when it comes to damages. So with the on time guarantee if our movers are late, we will start discounting your move immediately. If we don't make it in the agreed upon arrival window we will take $50 off right away for the first hour and then $25 more every half hour after that. Now when it comes to a damage protection our movers will change your furniture. Like it's our own everything will get padded before it leaves the room. That's just the furniture, even the floors, the walls and the door rais in need if needed on the way in and on the way out and on the rear oc something does get damaged there no worries. Damage coverage will cover-up. To $2,000 per.",
      "name": "Amy Arbasa",
      "time": "2026-10-15T19:20:53.834055",
